WEBVTT

00:49:27.042 --> 00:49:31.351
because passion for a long time
throughout history,

00:49:31.375 --> 00:49:33.809
when it came to work,
was pretty much the privilege

00:49:33.833 --> 00:49:35.875
of the artisans and the artists.

00:49:37.167 --> 00:49:39.976
People did not talk about passion
when they worked the land

00:49:40.000 --> 00:49:42.268
and certainly not
when they went to the factory.

00:49:42.292 --> 00:49:43.601
AG: Yeah.

00:49:43.625 --> 00:49:44.934
EP: So it really speaks

00:49:44.958 --> 00:49:48.309
to the aspirational meaning
that work has received.

00:49:48.333 --> 00:49:50.976
Never have we expected more from work.

00:49:51.000 --> 00:49:55.143
We want from work today what we used to
get from religion and community:

00:49:55.167 --> 00:49:58.768
belonging, purpose, meaning, community,

00:49:58.792 --> 00:50:01.643
you know, that's a whole new
set of expectations.